<title>UK: Geest appoints Menzies-Gow exec chairman.</title>
<headline>Geest appoints Menzies-Gow exec chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Convenience foods group Geest said on Monday that it had appointed Ian Menzies-Gow as full-time executive chairman.  </p>
<p>Menzies-Gow will join Geest on September 9 and will become chairman on October 1. Current chairman Mike Dowdall will stay as a director of Geest until the end of this year.</p>
<p>Meznies-Gow was an associate director of Hanson and, most recently, chairman of Hanson Amalgamated Industries.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
